WEBVTT

00:33.580 --> 00:37.020
=Royal Upstart 2=
(Based on "Zhenguan Foolish Son-in-Law")

00:37.325 --> 00:39.837
=Episode 28=

00:39.885 --> 00:42.600
(Wei the Fool's
Modernized Marquis Mansion)

00:46.120 --> 00:47.000
Brat,

00:47.440 --> 00:49.280
you haven't visited the palace lately.

00:50.160 --> 00:52.880
It seems we must get you
married as soon as possible

00:53.640 --> 00:56.000
and find you a position
in the palace early on.

00:58.759 --> 00:59.519
Father-in-law,

00:59.920 --> 01:01.120
let's not mention this today.

01:05.150 --> 01:06.280
Mother-in-law, you're better.

01:06.280 --> 01:07.590
Mother-in-law, please come on in.

01:07.879 --> 01:08.679
Alright.

01:09.000 --> 01:10.120
You brat.

01:14.180 --> 01:15.479
You look really beautiful today.

01:15.700 --> 01:18.039
- Congratulations, Your Majesty.
- Congratulations, Your Majesty.

01:19.500 --> 01:20.520
Why did you bump into me?

01:22.240 --> 01:23.840
Today

01:24.399 --> 01:25.320
is Wei Hao

01:25.679 --> 01:26.920
and Ning'an's

01:27.320 --> 01:28.399
engagement banquet.

01:28.679 --> 01:29.479
Please

01:29.759 --> 01:31.240
drink to your heart's content.

01:31.700 --> 01:33.479
- Thank you, Your Majesty.
- Thank you, Your Majesty.

01:33.479 --> 01:34.200
Father-in-law,

01:34.200 --> 01:35.000
please go upstairs.

01:36.079 --> 01:36.640
Wei Hao...

01:37.650 --> 01:38.320
Come, sit down.

01:38.399 --> 01:39.679
Have your parents returned?

01:39.920 --> 01:41.399
Sending letters is too slow nowadays.

01:41.640 --> 01:43.920
I expect they
will be back before the wedding.

01:44.799 --> 01:46.000
(Feel at Home)
Tell them to hurry back.

01:46.520 --> 01:47.200
The Empress

01:47.680 --> 01:48.480
and I

01:48.760 --> 01:51.239
plan to bestow the title of
Lady of Commandery on your mother.

01:51.719 --> 01:52.359
Really?

01:54.480 --> 01:55.519
Thank you, Mother-in-law.

01:57.719 --> 02:00.159
Do you not need to thank me too?

02:00.319 --> 02:02.799
Father-in-law,
I've noticed you are quite petty.

02:03.519 --> 02:04.510
Mother-in-law, this way.

02:07.040 --> 02:08.400
You brat.

02:11.519 --> 02:12.319
Ning'an,

02:13.359 --> 02:15.040
remember to come find me in a moment.

02:18.390 --> 02:19.439
His Majesty has arrived!

02:23.400 --> 02:25.490
- Greetings, Your Majesty.
- Greetings, Your Majesty.

02:25.500 --> 02:27.760
- Greetings, Your Highness.
- Greetings, Your Highness.

02:36.680 --> 02:38.439
(I won in the end.)

02:39.719 --> 02:41.239
(I didn't even have to do anything.)

02:41.599 --> 02:44.040
(My son-in-law won this round for me.)

02:44.680 --> 02:45.480
Today,

02:45.519 --> 02:48.599
I'm very happy that you could attend
Hao and Ning'an's engagement banquet.

02:48.920 --> 02:50.079
I am very pleased.

02:51.240 --> 02:52.360
Please be seated.

02:52.390 --> 02:53.960
- Thank you, Your Majesty.
- Thank you, Your Majesty.

02:55.039 --> 02:55.840
Wei Hao,

02:56.400 --> 02:57.199
come here.

02:57.520 --> 02:58.400
Sit over here.

02:59.080 --> 03:00.319
Father is calling you.

03:00.320 --> 03:02.080
I already said
I'm going to the ladies' side.

03:02.080 --> 03:03.159
Don't be foolish now.

03:04.840 --> 03:05.319
Ning...

03:09.159 --> 03:10.120
Father-in-law.

03:11.439 --> 03:13.240
I'll go greet the guests outside first.

03:14.080 --> 03:16.080
The clan leaders
and officials sent many gifts

03:16.439 --> 03:17.840
to celebrate my engagement.

03:18.400 --> 03:19.880
I'll go check if my aunt is finished.

03:24.960 --> 03:25.759
Thank

03:26.120 --> 03:27.120
you.

03:30.360 --> 03:31.800
Please look after me in the future.

03:32.159 --> 03:33.400
We'll look after each other.

03:34.960 --> 03:35.520
Everyone,

03:35.680 --> 03:36.520
eat and drink well.

03:37.919 --> 03:38.719
Wei Hao,

03:38.800 --> 03:39.439
come!

03:43.240 --> 03:44.319
Wei Hao, come here.

03:44.319 --> 03:45.560
Have a drink.

03:46.120 --> 03:47.080
Look at you,

03:47.319 --> 03:48.439
you're such a big fellow.

03:48.719 --> 03:50.560
I can't drink, I really can't.

03:50.919 --> 03:51.400
Well...

03:53.800 --> 03:54.800
Don't you dare

03:55.000 --> 03:57.680
use not having your capping
ceremony as an excuse with me.

03:57.840 --> 03:58.800
Mister Cheng,

03:58.800 --> 03:59.840
don't set me up.

04:00.199 --> 04:00.479
If...

04:00.500 --> 04:02.039
If my father-in-law
finds out I'm drinking

04:02.039 --> 04:04.879
without even offering him a toast first,
how will I live my life from now on?

04:04.919 --> 04:05.719
Look at this.

04:08.800 --> 04:09.840
Besides,

04:10.039 --> 04:12.400
once I have my capping ceremony
and come of age, I'll drink with you.

04:12.400 --> 04:14.100
You aren't leaving
until you admit defeat.

04:14.520 --> 04:15.280
Good lad.

04:15.280 --> 04:16.479
You've got some nerve.

04:16.479 --> 04:17.680
Cheng, did you see that?

04:18.000 --> 04:19.800
The one to challenge
your tolerance is here.

04:19.800 --> 04:20.520
Good.

04:20.520 --> 04:21.240
Wei Hao,

04:21.240 --> 04:22.479
just for that courage of yours,

04:22.479 --> 04:24.280
I respect you as a real man.

04:24.879 --> 04:25.639
All right, then.

04:25.639 --> 04:26.879
I'll be waiting for you.

04:27.599 --> 04:30.120
I'll be waiting for
the day of your ceremony.

04:30.120 --> 04:31.159
It's a deal.

04:31.159 --> 04:33.520
Come, I'll use water instead of liquor
to toast you all, sirs.

04:33.520 --> 04:34.080
Good.

04:35.599 --> 04:36.520
That's very thoughtful.

04:37.000 --> 04:37.800
Come.

04:44.280 --> 04:45.280
Eat and drink your fill.

04:45.599 --> 04:47.159
Pour it...

04:47.159 --> 04:49.200
(I won't even host a banquet
when I come of age.)

04:49.280 --> 04:50.759
(Who's going to drink with you, then?)

04:52.080 --> 04:53.599
- To Your Majesty.
- To Your Majesty.

04:53.680 --> 04:56.000
- To Your Highness.
- To Your Highness.

05:00.199 --> 05:01.000
I heard

05:01.800 --> 05:03.839
that you all had a very pleasant talk

05:04.600 --> 05:06.360
with Wei the Fool that day.

05:06.720 --> 05:07.519
Your Majesty,

05:08.360 --> 05:10.439
we were short-sighted.

05:10.600 --> 05:13.959
We held Marquis Wei in contempt

05:13.959 --> 05:15.160
and neglected him greatly.

05:15.360 --> 05:16.480
Our visit today

05:16.480 --> 05:19.279
is firstly to apologize to Your Majesty,

05:19.360 --> 05:21.959
and second,
to express our sincere regret

05:22.240 --> 05:23.040
to Marquis Wei

05:23.240 --> 05:25.560
in Your Majesty's presence.

05:26.160 --> 05:27.199
We ask Your Majesty

05:27.680 --> 05:28.879
to be our witness.

05:30.560 --> 05:33.879
Regarding the marriage
between Wei Hao and Ning'an...

05:34.480 --> 05:36.519
Marquis Wei is a man of great talent

05:36.519 --> 05:39.240
who possesses a heart
of loyalty and patriotism.

05:39.240 --> 05:42.199
He and the Eldest Princess
are a match made in heaven.

05:42.199 --> 05:43.959
From now on, all the great clans

05:44.000 --> 05:45.120
will show Marquis Wei

05:45.120 --> 05:47.399
and the Imperial Court
sincere respect and obedience,

05:47.399 --> 05:49.319
without any hesitation whatsoever.

05:50.000 --> 05:52.759
We show our sincere
respect and obedience.

05:53.800 --> 05:56.519
(What did Wei Hao show them)

05:56.800 --> 05:58.920
(to scare these overbearing fogies)

05:58.920 --> 06:00.000
(into this state?)

06:00.680 --> 06:02.480
Clan Leader Cui, that's too much.

06:03.839 --> 06:06.920
Regarding the marriage
of Wei Hao and Ning'an,

06:07.360 --> 06:09.199
that you are all so reasonable

06:09.199 --> 06:11.279
makes me very gratified.

06:14.240 --> 06:15.199
They

06:15.639 --> 06:16.439
say

06:17.240 --> 06:18.660
that the great clans are ganging up

06:19.000 --> 06:20.480
to deal with the Imperial Family.

06:29.360 --> 06:30.160
Now,

06:30.920 --> 06:33.199
seeing the attitude of you clan leaders,

06:33.560 --> 06:34.560
I

06:34.879 --> 06:37.360
won't believe those rumors anymore.

06:39.199 --> 06:40.279
The Imperial Family

06:40.839 --> 06:43.000
used to be a great clan as well.

06:43.360 --> 06:44.839
We are all in this together.

06:44.839 --> 06:47.240
How could we go against each other?

06:47.920 --> 06:49.959
We obey Your Majesty's will.

06:50.040 --> 06:52.959
- We all obey Your Majesty's will.
- We all obey Your Majesty's will.

06:54.600 --> 06:55.680
What are you talking about?

06:56.560 --> 06:58.959
About the Marquis Mansion you designed.

06:59.000 --> 07:00.680
Didn't you say it was already finished?

07:00.680 --> 07:01.480
It is.

07:01.720 --> 07:03.600
And I guarantee you'll love it.

07:08.560 --> 07:10.399
This house is unique.

07:13.199 --> 07:14.040
Father, Mother,

07:14.040 --> 07:14.839
look!

07:15.079 --> 07:16.839
It's so beautiful here.

07:17.800 --> 07:18.680
Gaoming, hurry up.

07:18.680 --> 07:19.959
Stop dawdling.

07:20.399 --> 07:21.160
Over here.

07:21.639 --> 07:22.680
Father-in-law,

07:22.839 --> 07:23.720
Mother-in-law,

07:24.000 --> 07:24.839
Brother-in-law,

07:25.639 --> 07:26.160
Aunt,

07:26.160 --> 07:26.879
come.

07:31.639 --> 07:32.439
Fool,

07:32.519 --> 07:33.759
is this all your residence?

07:33.959 --> 07:35.160
It's so beautiful.

07:35.160 --> 07:36.839
It's our residence.

07:37.120 --> 07:37.959
Wei the Fool,

07:38.040 --> 07:39.240
what did you build here?

07:39.240 --> 07:40.399
The ground is so hard,

07:40.680 --> 07:41.720
and yet so smooth.

07:42.000 --> 07:43.670
You wouldn't
understand even if I told you.

07:43.680 --> 07:45.590
Father-in-law, Mother-in-law,
please come inside.

07:45.600 --> 07:46.519
- Good.
- Good.

07:48.360 --> 07:49.120
Let's go, Gaoming.

07:49.120 --> 07:50.279
Let's have a look inside.

07:51.240 --> 07:52.040
Hao,

07:52.120 --> 07:53.759
no wonder you never let me visit.

07:53.800 --> 07:55.590
There'd be no
surprise if you came early.

07:55.920 --> 07:56.439
Let's go.

08:04.600 --> 08:05.439
What

08:05.480 --> 08:06.920
design is this?

08:09.480 --> 08:10.279
And...

08:10.279 --> 08:11.079
This...

08:11.199 --> 08:13.480
What is this transparent stuff?

08:14.279 --> 08:14.959
It's glass.

08:16.600 --> 08:17.600
Gaoming, look at that.

08:17.600 --> 08:18.519
It's glaze?

08:19.360 --> 08:20.160
It's just like

08:20.360 --> 08:21.199
that one.

08:24.319 --> 08:25.040
But

08:25.759 --> 08:27.600
this is so clear.

08:28.079 --> 08:29.680
And it's such a large piece.

08:29.879 --> 08:31.040
It's beautiful.

08:32.079 --> 08:33.360
The sunlight is great, too.

08:37.560 --> 08:38.240
If

08:38.439 --> 08:41.519
Ganlu Palace were
fitted with glaze like this,

08:41.879 --> 08:44.040
it wouldn't be so tiring for me

08:44.319 --> 08:45.920
to read during the day.

08:47.160 --> 08:48.720
Such a unique building.

08:48.920 --> 08:50.040
It's stunning.

08:51.519 --> 08:52.319
Mother-in-law,

08:52.580 --> 08:53.920
you can't see much from out here.

08:54.160 --> 08:54.519
Come.

08:54.720 --> 08:55.759
I'll show you the inside.

08:56.079 --> 08:56.759
Alright.

08:56.759 --> 08:57.480
Let's go.

09:14.000 --> 09:15.399
This two-story building

09:15.399 --> 09:17.080
is constructed of blackish bricks.

09:17.080 --> 09:18.320
It's not just made of wood.

09:20.879 --> 09:22.200
What are blackish bricks?

09:22.399 --> 09:23.200
How are they made?

09:23.200 --> 09:24.840
And what is this?

09:25.159 --> 09:26.600
It's so neat and clean.

09:27.879 --> 09:28.559
This

09:28.559 --> 09:29.799
looks just like porcelain.

09:31.200 --> 09:32.000
It's a floor tile.

09:32.559 --> 09:34.000
You're making such a fuss.

09:35.200 --> 09:35.759
Mother,

09:36.320 --> 09:38.879
these floors used to be
made of wooden planks.

09:39.360 --> 09:40.919
Not only did they creak when stepped on,

09:41.080 --> 09:42.720
but every year during the rainy season,

09:42.919 --> 09:44.080
we also had to spend a fortune

09:44.080 --> 09:45.720
on repairs due to mold.

09:46.080 --> 09:48.720
Now, not only are these tiles
perfectly level,

09:48.720 --> 09:50.120
but they also look very sturdy.

09:51.320 --> 09:51.960
It's wonderful.

09:52.919 --> 09:53.799
Wei Hao,

09:54.519 --> 09:57.120
I want to renovate the palace next year.

09:57.360 --> 09:57.960
So,

09:58.120 --> 09:59.120
you

09:59.159 --> 10:00.360
will handle it.

10:02.159 --> 10:03.360
Actually, I don't know how.

10:05.240 --> 10:06.000
Fine.

10:06.000 --> 10:06.720
I'll do it.

10:08.519 --> 10:09.080
Girl,

10:09.600 --> 10:10.200
come here.

10:15.080 --> 10:15.879
This

10:16.600 --> 10:17.919
was prepared for you.

10:18.840 --> 10:19.879
This is...

10:20.320 --> 10:21.759
A dressing table.

10:22.759 --> 10:24.679
It's certainly more
useful than the old one.

10:24.879 --> 10:27.159
And all these compartments
can hold so many things.

10:27.360 --> 10:28.320
Even a vanity case!

10:29.320 --> 10:30.120
But

10:30.320 --> 10:32.519
what is hidden under this red cloth?

10:32.519 --> 10:33.519
Sit tight.

10:34.279 --> 10:35.720
Don't blink.

10:56.000 --> 10:56.799
This is

10:57.799 --> 10:58.720
a mirror?

11:10.159 --> 11:11.039
In this world,

11:11.039 --> 11:13.159
how can there be such a clear mirror?

11:16.919 --> 11:18.890
It's surely clearer
than a bronze mirror, right?

11:19.039 --> 11:19.840
Yes,

11:19.840 --> 11:20.840
it's far too clear.

11:21.240 --> 11:22.039
Wei the Fool,

11:22.039 --> 11:23.080
how did you do this?

11:23.080 --> 11:24.200
A piece of cake.

11:25.879 --> 11:27.000
Aunt, Mother-in-law,

11:27.600 --> 11:29.679
I'm making your dressing tables as well.

11:29.679 --> 11:31.110
I'll give you small mirrors first.

11:31.159 --> 11:33.480
That way, when you travel,
it'll be more convenient.

11:33.519 --> 11:35.120
You can check your hair and such

11:35.120 --> 11:35.840
to keep it tidy.

11:37.279 --> 11:38.200
Good boy.

11:38.320 --> 11:39.399
I love it.

11:46.700 --> 11:48.039
If these are sold in the capital,

11:48.039 --> 11:49.919
the ladies there
will surely go crazy for them.

11:51.840 --> 11:52.679
Wei the Fool,

11:52.919 --> 11:54.919
I also need this in the Ganlu Palace.

11:55.720 --> 11:57.320
Father, you want one too?

11:59.399 --> 11:59.919
What?

12:00.159 --> 12:02.519
So, don't I need to get dressed?

12:03.840 --> 12:04.440
Brother-in-law,

12:05.240 --> 12:06.039
I...

12:06.039 --> 12:06.840
I understand.

12:07.240 --> 12:09.159
The Eastern Palace needs mirrors too, right?

12:09.159 --> 12:09.799
Great.

12:10.000 --> 12:11.159
Not bad, Brother-in-law.

12:11.759 --> 12:12.320
Oh, right.

12:12.320 --> 12:14.039
I also want

12:14.240 --> 12:15.080
this tiled floor.

12:15.080 --> 12:15.840
Yes.

12:15.919 --> 12:16.919
I like it too.

12:16.960 --> 12:18.159
Give me a 20-percent discount.

12:18.360 --> 12:20.200
These were all prepared for my wife.

12:20.200 --> 12:20.919
You guys...

12:21.960 --> 12:22.759
Fine.

12:22.919 --> 12:23.840
Please wait.

12:31.240 --> 12:32.320
Stop being so vain.

12:32.399 --> 12:34.710
You're so beautiful,
so you don't need to look so closely.

12:34.720 --> 12:36.200
What a sweet-talker.

12:36.919 --> 12:37.720
Do you like it?

12:39.039 --> 12:39.840
Yes.

12:40.080 --> 12:41.559
Not only do I like this mirror,

12:41.559 --> 12:42.720
but I also like it here.

12:44.039 --> 12:44.679
Great.

12:44.840 --> 12:46.600
Then, we'll get married right here.

12:51.000 --> 12:53.159
Your Majesty, the lords and the heads
of the great clans,

12:53.159 --> 12:55.380
who attended the banquet,
are heading over after finishing.

12:55.399 --> 12:57.120
They're asking if they
could also have a tour.

12:57.120 --> 12:57.840
No.

12:58.000 --> 12:59.120
Tell them to wait.

12:59.159 --> 13:00.600
I haven't finished seeing it myself.

13:00.799 --> 13:01.600
Yes, Your Majesty.

13:01.600 --> 13:02.240
How about this?

13:02.310 --> 13:04.320
Take them to
the other buildings for a tour first

13:04.320 --> 13:05.540
while they wait for
my father-in-law's audience.

13:05.559 --> 13:06.120
Wei the Fool,

13:06.559 --> 13:08.039
how many more buildings do you have?

13:08.440 --> 13:09.240
Father-in-law,

13:09.799 --> 13:12.279
this Marquis Mansion of mine
covers over 1,500 mu.

13:12.679 --> 13:13.759
When we get married,

13:13.760 --> 13:15.790
just give me a few more
personal maids as a dowry.

13:17.559 --> 13:19.320
Why did you build so many houses?

13:19.360 --> 13:20.990
Are you planning to
take many concubines?

13:23.080 --> 13:24.360
Dear, you know

13:24.360 --> 13:25.600
my family's situation is unique.

13:25.610 --> 13:28.000
Down to my generation,
it's been five generations of only sons.

13:28.000 --> 13:29.759
So my father wants me to have many sons.

13:29.759 --> 13:31.639
Wouldn't I need to take more concubines?

13:31.639 --> 13:32.840
What did you say?

13:33.080 --> 13:34.120
Wei the Fool,

13:34.320 --> 13:35.799
do you have a death wish?

13:35.799 --> 13:36.960
If you dare talk nonsense again,

13:36.960 --> 13:38.360
I'll have someone tear down
your houses in a bit.

13:38.360 --> 13:38.879
Believe me?

13:38.879 --> 13:39.890
I'm not talking nonsense.

13:39.919 --> 13:41.000
Everything I said is true.

13:41.000 --> 13:41.720
How about

13:41.720 --> 13:43.919
you just give me
a few more personal maids,

13:43.919 --> 13:45.399
and I'll take fewer concubines.

13:45.759 --> 13:46.639
My father said

13:46.840 --> 13:48.759
he wants me to have
enough sons for a polo team.

13:48.759 --> 13:50.240
How many women would that take?

13:50.759 --> 13:52.399
My father had five wives

13:52.399 --> 13:53.799
but only had one son, who is me.

13:54.000 --> 13:56.200
I heard my grandfather had
seven or eight wives

13:56.200 --> 13:58.000
just to have one son,
who is my father.

13:58.200 --> 14:00.000
This task is too daunting.

14:00.320 --> 14:01.200
It's a headache.

14:01.210 --> 14:03.080
I don't even know how many
concubines would be enough.

14:03.080 --> 14:03.440
Get

14:04.039 --> 14:06.000
lost, you fool!

14:06.159 --> 14:07.120
Concubines?

14:07.120 --> 14:07.720
Get him!

14:07.720 --> 14:08.720
Father-in-law, I was joking.

14:08.720 --> 14:10.919
You actually want more wives? You...

14:11.039 --> 14:12.399
Not the face.

14:12.399 --> 14:13.200
Hit his backside.

14:13.200 --> 14:14.159
Give him a real beating!

14:14.360 --> 14:15.559
How dare you bully my sister?

14:15.559 --> 14:16.519
Hit him.

14:16.519 --> 14:17.919
Don't hit my face.

14:18.039 --> 14:19.159
What a real fool.

14:19.159 --> 14:20.080
He dares to say anything.

14:20.080 --> 14:21.120
Shut his mouth!

14:21.120 --> 14:21.799
Father-in-law, that's not fair.

14:21.799 --> 14:22.500
Yes, Your Majesty.

14:26.412 --> 14:29.242
♪Everyone says I'm a big silly fool♪

14:29.862 --> 14:33.262
♪When things happen,
I only know how to count on my fingers♪

14:34.032 --> 14:36.982
♪They shake their heads
and say I'm pitiful♪

14:37.322 --> 14:40.022
♪Sigh and walk away♪

14:41.622 --> 14:45.092
♪Little do they know,
I am sharp and bright♪

14:45.092 --> 14:47.322
♪With a heart like a mirror,
I understand the world's♪

14:47.322 --> 14:49.432
♪Colors and darkness♪
(To be continued)

14:49.432 --> 14:51.452
♪But I keep my edge hidden♪

14:51.452 --> 14:55.812
♪The day I become famous
is just around the corner♪

14:57.252 --> 15:00.982
♪In the hotpot restaurant,
skewers boil in the broth♪

15:01.252 --> 15:04.852
♪People come and go,
with few worries or troubles♪

15:05.012 --> 15:07.092
♪The clacking of the abacus rings out♪

15:07.092 --> 15:11.882
♪See me differently.
Who dares to challenge me?♪

15:12.102 --> 15:13.722
♪The world mistakes me♪

15:13.722 --> 15:16.062
♪For an ignorant and stubborn fool♪

15:16.132 --> 15:17.322
♪As the storm approaches♪

15:17.322 --> 15:19.722
♪I just shrug and watch with a smile♪

15:19.932 --> 15:21.652
♪This foolish image is convenient♪

15:21.652 --> 15:23.632
♪I use it as a protective shield♪

15:23.802 --> 15:25.552
♪Navigating with ease, I attract♪

15:25.552 --> 15:27.652
♪A lucky star to accompany me♪

15:27.652 --> 15:29.122
♪In a peaceful golden age♪

15:29.122 --> 15:31.352
♪I hold my lady's hand
to watch the world♪

15:31.572 --> 15:32.772
♪Pouring youth and fireworks♪

15:32.772 --> 15:35.292
♪Into a precious glazed cup♪

15:35.422 --> 15:37.132
♪Having experienced life's changes♪

15:37.132 --> 15:38.412
♪And tasted its highs and lows♪

15:38.562 --> 15:39.982
♪My wish has finally come true♪

15:39.982 --> 15:41.022
♪To stay by your side♪

15:41.022 --> 15:42.942
♪In this fleeting world♪

15:43.112 --> 15:46.362
♪We are free and happy♪

15:48.275 --> 15:51.813
♪The world will finally
see my hidden light♪

15:51.900 --> 15:54.087
♪Amidst the tea leaves' drift,
I watch life's♪

15:54.152 --> 15:56.200
♪Joys and sorrows♪

15:56.362 --> 15:58.382
♪I keep my edge hidden♪

15:58.382 --> 16:02.742
♪The day I become famous
is just around the corner♪

16:04.182 --> 16:07.912
♪In the hotpot restaurant,
skewers boil in the broth♪

16:08.182 --> 16:11.782
♪People come and go,
with few worries or troubles♪

16:11.942 --> 16:14.022
♪The clacking of the abacus rings out♪

16:14.022 --> 16:18.812
♪See me differently.
Who dares to challenge me?♪

16:18.887 --> 16:20.667
♪From a nobody♪

16:20.667 --> 16:22.567
♪To someone now famous♪

16:22.677 --> 16:24.107
♪Ordinary people laugh at me♪

16:24.107 --> 16:26.617
♪But I laugh at how
they cannot see through it all♪

16:26.717 --> 16:28.297
♪Let others plot and scheme♪

16:28.297 --> 16:30.367
♪I will keep my heart unchanged♪

16:30.577 --> 16:32.257
♪In this vast world♪

16:32.257 --> 16:34.257
♪I find my own leisurely freedom♪

16:34.407 --> 16:36.617
♪The world is bustling,
and things constantly change♪

16:36.617 --> 16:38.207
♪Everything ends eventually♪

16:38.297 --> 16:39.797
♪All that remains before my eyes♪

16:39.797 --> 16:42.197
♪Is this street wandering,
still tinged with pity♪

16:42.197 --> 16:43.907
♪No matter how time flies♪

16:43.907 --> 16:45.067
♪Even if the falling snow♪

16:45.067 --> 16:46.697
♪Dyes the hair at our temples white♪

16:46.697 --> 16:47.737
♪All I want now♪

16:47.737 --> 16:49.837
♪Is to pray for
my lady's peace and safety♪

16:49.837 --> 16:53.097
♪Year after year♪
